{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpellChain is a spellcrafting action game set in a whimsical kingdom obsessed with eradicating magic. Grab your slightly too long pipe and embark on a magical crusade to take down a king you don\u2019t like very much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/67cc0c3718a7c513a1f9dd207a434e4e.poster.avif?t=1764068547\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/67cc0c3718a7c513a1f9dd207a434e4e.webm?t=1764068547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/94687a87b788f4af388794f238e5b21a.webp?t=1764068547\" width=464 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with your Spellbook, arrange your spells, experiment with combos, and chain your magics together in realtime. Practice in your training grounds before unleashing your Spell Chains on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/6b67076014471110e836f1164fe34b34.poster.avif?t=1764068547\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/6b67076014471110e836f1164fe34b34.webm?t=1764068547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/e1094df125d32c3f9159690ff8f5a571.webp?t=1764068547\" width=320 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some time to relax, try on some new hats, see if last year\u2019s robe still fits. Customize your wizard\u2019s look to boost your spellcasting or simply impress your enemies with your impeccable dresswork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/82e640a12d0295252c00adde87eaaf44.poster.avif?t=1764068547\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/82e640a12d0295252c00adde87eaaf44.webm?t=1764068547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/2dde9f65f2f327e86befeef948d17c48.webp?t=1764068547\" width=453 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, the kingdom bustles with new events, a wedding, a funeral, a farmers\u2019 market\u2026 all of which are perfectly fair targets for some magical &quot;interruptions&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/229915f8cb1f24fd9415275af93e42df.poster.avif?t=1764068547\" width=1170 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/229915f8cb1f24fd9415275af93e42df.webm?t=1764068547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai